2. **Tests** in `Tests/<Module>Tests`:
   - hand-worked cases;
   - edge cases: empty input, one element, the boundaries of every range;
   - `checked:` spellings and their errors;
   - exit tests for every trap;
   - a property test against a naive reference (`swift-property-based`).
<!-- mutation:...

- Each test is self-contained and portable: no assertion or setup helpers, not DRY; a test
  copied to another file still works. Shared fixture data in `ProjectNameTestSupport` is tolerated;
  shared assertions are not.

- **Terraform:** nazwy zasobów Pub/Sub i tabel pilnuje `tests/test_terraform_names.py`;
  pierwszy apply dwuetapowy przez `deploy_service`. Loadera batchowego jako Cloud Run Job
  świadomie NIE ma - chmurowa idempotentność wymaga load joba + `MERGE`, nie `rename`.

This mirrors `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (separate `lint` and `test` jobs;
`test` runs on Python 3.11–3.15 on Linux plus one Windows 3.14 smoke job
to guard against stdio newline regressions).

